---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contributing to HOBA" activeNav="contribute">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="border-b border-hoba-border pb-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase font-bold text-hoba-accent tracking-wider">Git-First Knowledge Curation</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black font-mono text-hoba-text mt-1">Contributing Guide</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-hoba-muted mt-2">
        How to submit new observations, structural barriers, mechanisms, and intervention proposals via Git PRs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-hoba-border bg-hoba-card space-y-4 text-xs font-mono">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-hoba-text">Contributor Workflow</h2>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-hoba-bg border border-hoba-border space-y-2">
        <p class="text-emerald-300">git clone https://github.com/dmytro-yemelianov/hoba.work.git</p>
        <p class="text-emerald-300">pnpm install</p>
        <p class="text-emerald-300">pnpm test</p>
        <p class="text-emerald-300">pnpm validate</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Automated Pull-Request Checks -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-hoba-border bg-hoba-card space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold font-mono text-hoba-text">Automated Pull-Request CI Checks</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-hoba-muted">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Zod Schema strict conformance</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Referential integrity across all IDs</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Barrier DAG topological sort (strictly acyclic)</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Tarjan SCC validation for causal loops</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Honest baseline preservation check</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Zero company/individual identifiers in public text</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
